            {
               "text": "<center><div class=\"first_steps_reflection_parent\"><div class=\"first_steps_reflection question_mark\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-brain\"></i></div><div class=\"first_steps_reflection\"><b>Reflection: Where do stars come from?</b><br /><br />Stars are born inside clouds of gas and dust, and the process takes thousands of years — far longer than any human life.<br /><br />If you could watch one star being born, what would you like to see first?<br /><br />There is no single right answer. Write down or say out loud what you think.</div></div></center></p>",
